{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47126","headline":"经贺监旧居 · 虚中","name":"经贺监旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不恋明皇宠，归来镜水隅。\n道装汀鹤识，春醉钓人扶。\n逐朵云如吐，成行雁侣驱。\n兰亭名景在，踪迹未爲孤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虚中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47126.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47126","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}